  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions as interposing hand, except that it can also grapple one opponent as grasping hand. Its CMB and CMD for grapple checks use your caster level in place of its base attack bonus, with a +12 bonus for its Strength score (35) and a +1 bonus for being Large (its Dexterity is 10, granting no bonus to the CMD). A crushing hand deals 2d6+12 points of damage on each successful grapple check against an opponent. The crushing hand can instead be directed to bull rush a target (as forceful hand), using the same bonuses outlined above, or it can be directed to interpose itself, as interposing hand does.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell functions as interposing hand, except that it can also grapple one opponent as grasping hand. its cmb and cmd for grapple checks use your caster level in place of its base attack bonus, with a +12 bonus for its strength score (35) and a +1 bonus for being large (its dexterity is 10, granting no bonus to the cmd). a crushing hand deals 2d6+12 points of damage on each successful grapple check against an opponent. the crushing hand can instead be directed to bull rush a target (as forceful hand), using the same bonuses outlined above, or it can be directed to interpose itself, as interposing hand does.\"",
